# Expression — hand-authored, not imported. Two blend-shape weight curves and nothing else.
#
# ⚠ This file is the point. Everything else about blend shapes in Vixen was reachable only from a
# model an artist exported: the deltas come out of a .gltf, and until now so did the curve that
# drove them. `property: Weight` with a `shape:` beside it is what an author can type, and this is
# the first file in the repository that types it.
#
# ⚠ `shape` is a NAME and not a slot, and that is load-bearing. The import drops a shape that moves
# nothing above the threshold and deduplicates the names of the rest, so a source file's ordinal is
# not MeshData.MorphTargets'. A curve stored against an index would re-target itself the next time
# somebody re-exported the head. See docs/guide/rendering/blend-shapes.md.
#
# ⚠ `target` names the morphed mesh's NODE — Head, the node in head.gltf — and not a joint. That is
# why AnimationClip.Create resolves a weight channel before it looks a joint up: a face's curves in
# UnresolvedChannels would drown the number that count exists for.
#
# ⚠ `version: 2` is a compatibility FENCE and not a re-import trigger, unlike the two binary bumps
# beside it. This is YAML bound by name and the value that moved is inside an enum, which
# YamlSerializer binds with Enum.Parse — an older editor meeting `property: Weight` throws. A clip
# with no weight curve is still written as version 1, so nothing else in a project is fenced.
#
# The shapes hold near full for most of the cycle rather than passing through it, so that a capture
# of any single frame in the middle of the loop is a picture of the morph rather than a coin toss.
version: 2
name: Expression
duration: 2.4
frameRate: 30
wrap: Loop
targets:
  - target: Head
    curves:
      - property: Weight
        shape: jawOpen
        keys:
          - time: 0.0000
            value: 0.000000
            mode: Auto
          - time: 0.5000
            value: 1.000000
            mode: Auto
          - time: 1.9000
            value: 1.000000
            mode: Auto
          - time: 2.4000
            value: 0.000000
            mode: Auto
      - property: Weight
        shape: browRaise
        keys:
          - time: 0.0000
            value: 0.000000
            mode: Auto
          - time: 0.7000
            value: 0.900000
            mode: Auto
          - time: 1.7000
            value: 0.900000
            mode: Auto
          - time: 2.4000
            value: 0.000000
            mode: Auto
events: []
